            "elements": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Btw, in the code_buffer_slot test, cfd buffer is being created but not closed. Is that intentional? From my experiments, its still being closed after the end of program, and my custom release is being called, but because all contexts are cleaned-up, the test fails (to put it mildly)"
              }
